"""Phase 12 controller (rl/PHASE12-CP7.md): warm start each deck main to competence vs CP7.

One lane at a time, blocks rotate M_D (BenchDimir), M_L (G1Landfall), M_W (W0Base); a
graduated main stops training.  Per trainee block: one 256-episode block of
rl/rung0_lane_league.sh resumed from the main's own OUT dir (/tmp/rl_12_<main>/agent.pt),
opponent from the pre-stated 75 % CP7 / 25 % heuristic mix on the own mirror, realised
EXACTLY per 1,024-episode window by the fixed rotation cp7, heuristic, cp7, cp7 (Phase 10's
Amendment 3 lesson: random draws under-delivered a 10-15 % bucket), then the 25-game CP7
census check (rl/record_census.sh, fixed seed 12500 so every check sees the same deals).
At every 1,024 episodes of a main: the 100-game CP7 level + the 50-game heuristic guard
(rl/battery_xdeck.sh; its row seeds are fixed, so every level sees the same deals).
Graduated = CP7 level >= 0.70 AND Wilson lower bound >= 0.60; the unseen 3-deck suite
(heuristic on BenchBurn / HoldoutControl / HoldoutMidrange, 50 each) at the start, at
graduation, and at the end for a main that did not graduate.
Before training ("start" task per main): CP7 100 + heuristic 50 + unseen 150 + the census.

Lines: L12|start|..  L12|block|..  L12|tput|..  L12|check|..  L12|level|..  L12|grad|..
       L12|end|..  L12|done|reason=..
Resumable: state in rl/artifacts/v7/12/state.json (pending block, todo list, clock).
Stop: touch rl/artifacts/v7/12/STOP (finishes the current step; no end phase).
"""
